use firn/tags

sbcl is a Module
sbcl is tagged doom-emacs
sbcl is tagged lisp

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.sbcl.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.sbcl]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."sbcl"."enable": enable "Steel Bank Common Lisp compiler"
